  *   An avalanche has been reported by some wandering dwarves in    *
  *   the sloping tundra area at the foot of the Tor Androg          *
  *   Mountains, which has revealed a heretofore undiscovered thin   *
  *   mountain trail. There are rumours that if the trail is         *
